OL,3,AMinister refuses to rule out some young
OL,4,Apeople may lose benefits after Milburn
OL,5,Areview
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe report's author, Alan Milburn,
OL,8,Ftells the show it's important to be
OL,9,F"candid with people" that under his
OL,10,Frecommendations it would take 10 years
OL,11,Ffor the benefits bill to come down
OL,13,FShadow work and pensions secretary
OL,14,FHelen Whately says that some young
OL,15,Fpeople should have their entitlements
OL,16,Fcut: "When somebody has a mild
OL,17,Fcondition... they shouldn't be
OL,18,Freceiving cash benefits"
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
